{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/setup-steps-everything-done-walk",
  "seed": "A Mac with all of setup already done: Screen Recording on, the microphone answered, the screenshot keys free and Photonz in every agent tool. An install that is past its first launch sees no window at all. A brand new install on such a Mac skips every step and is shown only the tour offer, once. At Next defaults, no switch changed.",
  "setup": {
    "forget": ["tutorials"]
  },
  "steps": [
